{title: Teri Galiyon Me Na Rakhenge Kadam}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Usha Khanna}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E]Teri galiyon mein na
[B]rakhenge kadam
[A]aaj [E]ke baad
[E]tere milne ko na
[B]ayenge sanam
[A]aaj [E]ke baad
[Am]Tu mera [E]milna samaj
[A]lena ik sapna tha
[B]tujko ab mil hi gaya
[E]jo tera apna tha
[E]hum ko duniya mein
[B]samajna na sanam
[A]aaj [E]ke baad
[Am]Ghirke [E]ayegi ghataein
[A]phirse sawam ki
[B]tum toh bahon mein rahogi
[E]apne sajan ki
[E]galey hum ghum ko
[B]lagayenge sanam
[A]aaj [E]ke baad
